# 换行策略:Windows 工作副本默认可为 CRLF,但脚本与包装器必须保持 LF
# (Linux CI 与 Android Gradle Wrapper 依赖 shebang,CRLF 会导致 "bad interpreter")
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.bash  text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源:禁止文本转换,避免跨平台副本被改写
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.bmp binary
*.so    binary
*.dll   binary
*.lib   binary
*.a     binary
*.zip   binary
